<title>JAPAN: Stock ratings list - Nomura Securities (Apr 10).</title>
<headline>Stock ratings list - Nomura Securities (Apr 10).</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Follows is a list of ratings on Thursday by Nomura Securities Co Ltd.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Rating unchanged:</p>
<p>Marui Co Ltd -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Japan Wool Textile Co Ltd -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Ryohin Keikaku Co Ltd -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Sawako Corporation -- &quot;1&quot;</p>
<p>Taisei Fire and Marine Insurance Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>Koa Fire and Marine Insurance Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>Nichido Fire and Marine Insurance Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>Seiren Co Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>Teijin Ltd -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>Homac Corp -- &quot;2&quot;</p>
<p>NIDEC Corp -- &quot;2&quot; --------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Nomura assigns ratings as follows:</p>
<p>&quot;1&quot; - issues expected to outperform the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
<p>&quot;2&quot; - issues seen moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the key 225-share Nikkei average over the next six months.</p>
<p>&quot;3&quot; - issues expected to underperform the key 225-share Nikkei average by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
